   into it). Linux and the image.

3. Swift: the runtime, the standard library, Concurrency and _StringProcessing
   (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE)
   https://github.com/swiftlang/swift
   https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-experimental-string-processing
   Apache-2.0 WITH Swift-exception, in [B]. Linux and the image.

4. Foundation: FoundationEssentials (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE)
   https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-foundation
   Apache-2.0 WITH Swift-exception, in [B]. Linux and the image.

5. libdispatch (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE)
   https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-corelibs-libdispatch
   Apache-2.0 WITH Swift-exception, in [B]. Linux and the image.

6. LLVM's libc++, libc++abi and libunwind (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE)
   https://github.com/swiftlang/llvm-project
   Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, in [C]. Linux and the image.

7. musl, the C library, as Swift's Static Linux SDK builds it
   (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE_static-linux-0.1.0)
   https://musl.libc.org
   MIT, in [D]. Linux and the image.

8. musl-fts, NetBSD's fts, as the Static Linux SDK builds it
   https://github.com/void-linux/musl-fts
   BSD-3-Clause, in [E]. Linux and the image.

9. mimalloc, the memory allocator the Static Linux SDK links
   https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc
   MIT, in [F]. Linux and the image.

10. uuid.c, the UUID generator in swift-foundation's _FoundationCShims
    (swift-6.4.0-RELEASE), Copyright (c) 2004 Apple Computer, Inc.
    https://github.com/swiftlang/swift-foundation/blob/swift-6.4.0-RELEASE/Sources/_FoundationCShims/uuid.c
    A BSD licence of three clauses, in its own words in [G] — not swift-
    foundation's Apache License with the Runtime Library Exception, which
    covers the rest of 4. Linux and the image.



